  'spec.smile': 'Models »smile 320 | 420 | 620«: tool length up to 350/420/600 mm (800 mm with base cabinet), Ø up to 320/420/620 mm. SK 50 spindle with runout < 2 µm, one-hand control »eQ« – robust, for standard tools and small to medium batches, right next to the machine.',
  'spec.venturion': '»venturion 450«: tool length 450/620/820 mm, Ø 420/620 mm. CNC-controlled with autofocus and »pilot 4.0« – operator-independent measuring; the »ace« spindle changes adapters in 10 s with < 1 µm; built for 24-hour operation.',
  'spec.venturion600': '»venturion 600«: tool length 600–1200 mm, Ø 600/800 mm – for large, heavy and long tools (e.g. SK 50, HSK-A100).',
  'spec.venturion800': '»venturion 800«: tool length 600–1600 mm, Ø 1000–1400 mm – for very large tools.',
  'spec.hyperion': 'Horizontal presetting and measuring machine for turning: turret table with 4 to 12 stations, holders for almost every system (e.g. VDI, Capto, Index, Traub). »hyperion 300 | 500 | 700« with Z 350/500/700 mm. 20 % more productivity from batch size 1.',
  'spec.redomatic': 'Presetting, measuring and shrinking in one machine: length accurate to < 10 µm, a shank tool done in about 2–3 min. Tool length 600–1000 mm, Ø 420–800 mm, shank up to 32 mm (50 mm with 22 kVA coil).',
  'spec.powershrink': '»powerShrink 200 | 300 | 400 | 600«: shrink length 400/600 mm (»400 | 11«: modular tools up to 1100 mm), shank Ø 3–32 mm (»600« with 22 kVA coil Ø 16–50 mm). Heating 2–7 s, cooling 60–120 s, up to 30 % less energy.',
  'spec.toolbalancer': 'Balancing quality < 0.4 gmm, spindle speed 400–1200 rpm, »twinPanel« safety hood to DIN ISO 21940-23 class C60.',
  'spec.keeper': 'Cabinet for complete tools: 3 or 5 drawers with 6 frames each, up to 14 tools per frame (SK 40, HSK 63) or 8 (SK 50, HSK 100) – up to 420 tools; 2000 × 1000 × 1050 mm.',
  'spec.toolorganizer': 'Drawer cabinet for cutting tools, components and small parts: »toolOrganizer 600 | 900 | 1225«, up to 80 kg per drawer (optionally 160 kg), LEDs show the right compartment.',
  'spec.twister': 'Rotary cabinet for tool components and accessories: 6 or 8 levels, dispensing lift to the access flap; 1830 × 803 × 970 mm.',
  'spec.autolock': 'Cabinet for gauges, consumables and larger components: 4–9 drawers, up to 80 kg each, door unlocks after release in the software.',
  'spec.toolstation': 'Assembly workbench, 2450 mm wide: perforated back wall, up to two »toolOrganizer 600«, 24" touch panel PC and assembly fixture.',
  'spec.ztower': 'Compact assembly island for universal tool assembly, 1260 or 1490 mm wide, optionally with »toolOrganizer 600«.',
  'spec.zidcode': 'For production without a network: scan the QR code from the presetter – data go into the control via USB keyboard emulation, RS-232 or network cable (e.g. FANUC, HAAS). About 1 h installation per machine.',
  'spec.zidcode40': 'For networked production: scan the »idChip« or »idLabel«, the data come from the database; with »z.DMI« directly into the tool memory (OKUMA, MAKINO, FANUC, HEIDENHAIN, Matsuura, Mazak, SIEMENS), tool life back into z.One. About ½ day per machine.',
  'spec.idchip': 'Coded chip with DataMatrix code, bonded into the holder – the better choice for rotating tools (HSK-A, SK, PSC from ZOLLER Tooling Solutions).',
  'spec.idlabel': 'Resin-coated label with DataMatrix code – recommended for turning tools and fixtures that do not rotate.',
  'spec.toolcart': '»toolCart 750«: up to 250 kg payload, tool change frames with up to 13 tools (SK 40, HSK 63) or 7 (SK 50, HSK 100) per frame.',
  'spec.loadbox': 'Tool centre with FANUC robot and Kardex lift: up to 2380 tools, length up to 450 mm, Ø up to 120 mm, up to 10 kg; picks onto »smartPallet« pallets.',
  'spec.coramachineload': 'The »coraArm« robot loads the machine tool magazine from »smartPallet« pallets – parallel to production and independent of the machine maker.',
  'spec.coralogistic': 'The mobile robot »coraExpress« (AMR) moves »smartPallet« pallets between storage, tool preparation and machine.',
  'spec.robobox': 'Automated assembling, shrinking, cooling and measuring with up to 6 modules: tools up to 450 mm, shank Ø 5–25 mm, up to 10 kg. Payback 2.3 years at 480 tools per day.',
  'spec.corameasure': 'Automation cell with gantry robot and »venturion«: measures tools from »smartPallet« pallets fully automatically; 2000 × 3150 × 1785 mm.',
  'spec.micbox': 'Mounts, rotates, turns and changes indexable inserts on milling tools fully automatically – up to six grippers, tools up to 20 kg.',
  'spec.genius': 'Universal measuring machine for cutting tools: over 100 parameters, tool length up to 600 mm, Ø up to 400 mm; certified by DAkkS.',
  'spec.titan': 'Top-class universal measuring machine on granite with active vibration damping; optional edge preparation and roughness.',
  'spec.hobcheck': 'Measuring machine for hobs and gear cutting tools.',
